# AiT project rules

Go CLI (**AI Terminal**). Module: `github.com/os-artificer/AiT`.

## Commands

- `make build` → `bin/ait` from `./cmd/ait`
- `make test` / `make vet` / `make fmt` — run after Go edits

## Layout

- `cmd/ait`: minimal `main` only
- `internal/ait`: application entry (`Run`, CLI, core logic)
- `pkg/`: only code meant for external import
- Follow per-directory `README.md` for `api/`, `configs/`, `deployments/`, etc.

## Scope

- Match existing style (tabs in Go, `.editorconfig`)
- No drive-by refactors; no new markdown unless asked
- Do not commit unless the user requests it
- Do not edit `.git/` or add secrets
